  "description": "Betrayed by someone she held dear, Rizi's previous life ended with the fall of the guillotine... or it would have. Rizi awakens to find herself three years in the past, back before her life turned for the worse, back before people she thought she knew changed right before her eyes. Rizi won't be blinded again. This time, she'll cut tragedy off at the source.\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
